 dated operational designations; this receipt does not identify any historical named eddy or prove persistence between releases.","label":"NAVO W26002 — 2026-09-25","observation_date":"2026-09-25","provider_code":"W26002","provider_rotation":"Anticyclonic","provider_type":"Warm","setting":"regional","source_id":"source:179111cb1095bbc9","source_record_id":"W26002","source_snapshot_id":"source:b1016cce3ed2285c","time_behavior":"unresolved","type":"operational_eddy_detection","vertical_setting":"unresolved"},{"almanac_url":"reference-routes.html#inventory-addition-southern-east-madagascar","basin":"Southwest Indian Ocean","catalogue_version":"0.2.0-draft","id":"current:southern-east-madagascar","identity_admission_id":"current_admission:southern-east-madagascar","identity_level":"current","identity_scope_note":"Southward East Madagascar Current along southeast Madagascar. This proposal resolves the southern branch explicitly; it does not include the northward branch, underlying equatorward East Madagascar Undercurrent, offshore South Indian Ocean Countercurrent, or downstream eddies.","label":"Southern East Madagascar Current","setting":"western_boundary","source_id":"source:dddb5c5db92e5fe3","source_kind":"source-defined southward western boundary current","source_record_id":"southern-east-madagascar","time_behavior":"persistent_variable","type":"named_current","vertical_setting":"surface_expression"},{"almanac_url":"reference-routes.html#inventory-addition-norwegian-atlantic-slope","basin":"Norwegian Sea / Nordic Seas","catalogue_version":"0.3.0-draft-nwasc","id":"current:norwegian-atlantic-slope","identity_admission_id":"current_admission:norwegian-atlantic-slope","identity_level":"current","identity_scope_note":"Atlantic-water eastern slope branch along the Norwegian continental margin, with northern bifurcation. Distinct from ambiguous Norwegian Current, coastal current and western frontal branch. Parent Norwegian Atlantic Current remains a separately proposed identity.","label":"Norwegian Atlantic Slope Current","setting":"polar_or_subpolar_margin","source_id":"source:nwasc-baumann-2026","source_kind":"source-defined Atlantic-water slope current","source_record_id":"norwegian-atlantic-slope","time_behavior":"persistent_variable","type":"named_current"},{"almanac_url":"object.html?id=current%3Awest-india-coastal","basin":"Arabian Sea, northern Indian Ocean","catalogue_version":"0.2.0-draft-indian-coastal","id":"current:west-india-coastal","identity_admission_id":"current_admission:west-india-coastal","identity_level":"current","identity_scope_note":"West coast of India. Typical equatorward summer and poleward winter flow; strong intraseasonal variability can produce either direction at a particular time.","label":"West India Coastal Current","setting":"eastern_boundary","source_id":"source:indian-coastal-identities-vinayachandran-2021","source_kind":"original_published_review_for_naming_and_qualitative_scope_not_new_observations","source_locator":"Sections2.7.1 and2.7.3; printed5989 and5992 / PDF23 and26","source_record_id":"west-india-coastal","time_behavior":"seasonally_reversing","type":"named_current","vertical_setting":"unspecified"},{"almanac_url":"object.html?id=current%3Aeast-india-coastal","basin":"Bay of Bengal, northern Indian Ocean","catalogue_version":"0.2.0-draft-indian-coastal","id":"current:east-india-coastal","identity_admission_id":"current_admission:east-india-coastal","identity_level":"current","identity_scope_note":"East coast of India, western Bay of Bengal. Variable coastal flow. Some sources distinguish a pre-summer poleward Western Boundary Current from the equatorward EICC; no uniform continuous annual reversal is imposed here.","label":"East India Coastal Current","setting":"western_boundary","source_id":"source:indian-coastal-identities-vinayachandran-2021","source_kind":"original_published_review_for_naming_and_qualitative_scope_not_new_observations","source_locator":"Section2.9.1; printed5996 / PDF30","source_record_id":"east-india-coastal","time_behavior":"seasonal_intraseasonal_variable","type":"named_current","vertical_setting":"unspecified"},{"almanac_url":"object.html?id=current%3Aeast-african-coastal","basin":"Southwestern Indian Ocean","catalogue_version":"0.2.0-draft-indian-coastal","id":"current:east-african-coastal","identity_admission_id":"current_admission:east-african-coastal","identity_level":"current","identity_scope_note":"Coasts of Tanzania and Kenya. Source describes a northward prevailing orientation throughout the year, contrasting with the reversing Somali Current. This is not an every-sample direction guarantee.","label":"East African Coastal Current","setting":"western_boundary","source_id":"source:indian-coastal-identities-vinayachandran-2021","source_kind":"original_published_review_for_naming_and_qualitative_scope_not_new_observations","source_locator":"Section2.4.1; printed5983 / PDF17","source_record_id":"east-african-coastal","time_behavior":"persistent_variable","type":"named_current","vertical_setting":"unspecified"},{"almanac_url":"object.html?id=current%3Asouth-java","basin":"Eastern Indian Ocean","catalogue_version":"0.2.0-draft-indian-coastal","id":"current:south-java","identity_admission_id":"current_admission:south-java","identity_level":"current","identity_scope_note":"Coastal waters south of Java. Source explicitly describes a reversing South Java Current associated with seasonal upwelling. Exact monthly phase limits are not assigned.","label":"South Java Current","setting":"eastern_boundary","source_id":"source:indian-coastal-identities-vinayachandran-2021","source_kind":"original_published_review_for_naming_and_qualitative_scope_not_new_observations","source_locator":"Section2.10.3; printed6000 / PDF34","source_record_id":"south-java","time_behavior":"seasonally_reversing","type":"named_current","vertical_setting":"unspecified"},{"id":"current:atlantic-north-equatorial","label":"Atlantic North Equatorial Current","